OL,3,AFour works of art, worth millions,
OL,4,Astolen from Renoir museum in France
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo thieves have stolen four works of
OL,7,Fart from a Renoir museum in France -
OL,8,Fdropping one as they fled, the local
OL,9,Fmayor says
OL,11,FThe mayor's office says the estimated
OL,12,Fvalue of the stolen art is 9m euros
OL,13,F($7.7m; $10.5m), French media reports
OL,15,FThe museum's alarm went off at 05:48
OL,16,Flocal time (04:48 BST), with police
OL,17,Farriving five minutes later
OL,19,FThe thieves have not been caught, the
OL,20,Fmayor adds
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
